<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'">(1)学校成立教师招聘工作监督小组，进行全程监督，同时接受</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=仿宋_GB2312>市纪委市监委驻市教育局纪检监察组、市人力社保局、市教育局的监督</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'"><FONT face=仿宋>，对违反招考纪律人员，按有关规定严肃处理。监督电话：</FONT>0575-85173849。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
